{"id":"a3d01ee2a38f6e35","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-canonical-cfg-binary-code.md","title":"自然数标号 CFG 的规范二进制代码","display":"df-canonical-cfg-binary-code — 自然数标号 CFG 的规范二进制代码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-canonical-cfg-binary-code","aliases":["73-df-canonical-cfg-binary-code"],"display":"df-canonical-cfg-binary-code — 自然数标号 CFG 的规范二进制代码","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-structure]]","[[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]","[[73-df-encoding]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§9.5.2–9.5.3, print pp. 413–418; PDF pp. 435–440; explicit local syntax code","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":9},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-canonical-cfg-binary-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-canonical-cfg-binary-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-canonical-cfg-binary-code — 自然数标号 CFG 的规范二进制代码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"33052f37223a11c6\" href=\"?note=33052f37223a11c6\" title=\"73-df-cfg-structure\">73-df-cfg-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bc88ca69b33d5036\" href=\"?note=bc88ca69b33d5036\" title=\"73-df-binary-natural-representation\">73-df-binary-natural-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2c2693f4159269f6\" href=\"?note=2c2693f4159269f6\" title=\"73-df-encoding\">73-df-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.5.2–9.5.3, print pp. 413–418; PDF pp. 435–440; explicit local syntax code"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N)\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega})\">\\(Y\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lex}\">\\(\\mathrm{lex}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2c2693f4159269f6\" href=\"?note=2c2693f4159269f6\" title=\"73-df-encoding\">73-df-encoding</a> 的自然数元组字典序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是排序条件中的位置变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota x\\in A\\;P(x)\">\\(\\iota x\\in A\\;P(x)\\)</span> 是唯一描述记号，仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists!x\\in A\\;P(x)\">\\(\\exists!x\\in A\\;P(x)\\)</span> 时表示该唯一元素；下面先断言排序见证的存在唯一性，再使用该记号定义排序函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NCFG}\">\\(\\mathsf{NCFG}\\)</span> 在下式定义；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_P\">\\(Y_P\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CFGCode}\">\\(\\operatorname{CFGCode}\\)</span> 的子句中，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\\)</span>，各分量均为该文法的投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NumCode}\">\\(\\operatorname{NumCode}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NatListCode}\">\\(\\operatorname{NatListCode}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bc88ca69b33d5036\" href=\"?note=bc88ca69b33d5036\" title=\"73-df-binary-natural-representation\">73-df-binary-natural-representation</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N)\\;\\exists!\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n[|\\tau|=|X|\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\tau)=X\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\tau|-1\\}\\;(i&lt;j\\Longrightarrow\\tau(i)&lt;\\tau(j))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N)\\;\\exists!\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n[|\\tau|=|X|\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\tau)=X\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\tau|-1\\}\\;(i&lt;j\\Longrightarrow\\tau(i)&lt;\\tau(j))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall Y\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega})\\;\\exists!\\rho\\in(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega})^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n[|\\rho|=|Y|\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)=Y\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\rho|-1\\}\\;(i&lt;j\\Longrightarrow(\\rho(i),\\rho(j))\\in\\mathrm{lex})].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall Y\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega})\\;\\exists!\\rho\\in(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega})^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n[|\\rho|=|Y|\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)=Y\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\rho|-1\\}\\;(i&lt;j\\Longrightarrow(\\rho(i),\\rho(j))\\in\\mathrm{lex})].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sort}(X)\\coloneqq\\iota\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n[|\\tau|=|X|\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\tau)=X\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|\\tau|\\;\\tau(i)&lt;\\tau(j)],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sort}(X)\\coloneqq\\iota\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n[|\\tau|=|X|\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\tau)=X\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|\\tau|\\;\\tau(i)&lt;\\tau(j)],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LexSort}(Y)\\coloneqq\\iota\\rho\\in(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega})^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n[|\\rho|=|Y|\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)=Y\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|\\rho|\\;(\\rho(i),\\rho(j))\\in\\mathrm{lex}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LexSort}(Y)\\coloneqq\\iota\\rho\\in(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega})^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n[|\\rho|=|Y|\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)=Y\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|\\rho|\\;(\\rho(i),\\rho(j))\\in\\mathrm{lex}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NCFG}\\coloneqq\\{(V,\\Sigma,P,S):\\Sigma,V\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\n(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NCFG}\\coloneqq\\{(V,\\Sigma,P,S):\\Sigma,V\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\n(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Y_P\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A\\rangle\\alpha:(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{NumCode}(S)\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\operatorname{Sort}(V))\n\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\operatorname{Sort}(\\Sigma))\n\\operatorname{NumCode}(|P|)\n\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=0}^{|P|-1}\n\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\operatorname{LexSort}(Y_P)(j))\n\\quad(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Y_P\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A\\rangle\\alpha:(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{NumCode}(S)\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\operatorname{Sort}(V))\n\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\operatorname{Sort}(\\Sigma))\n\\operatorname{NumCode}(|P|)\n\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=0}^{|P|-1}\n\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\operatorname{LexSort}(Y_P)(j))\n\\quad(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限全序集有唯一递增枚举；所有字段都自定界，规则的首元素是左部变量，余词是右部，可为空。自然数标签足以有效表示有限 CFG 并实施本节归约；不宣称任意集合标签自带一个未给定的有效数字表示。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-natural-representation","status":"resolved","id":"bc88ca69b33d5036","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"2c2693f4159269f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"2c2693f4159269f6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N)$，$Y\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N^{<\\omega})$；$\\mathrm{lex}$ 采用 [[73-df-encoding]] 的自然数元组字典序。$i,j\\in\\mathbb N$ 是排序条件中的位置变量。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-bi